==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**6 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Razorback]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns.
**6 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Build up [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cats]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]], [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] on the opening wave of enemies, then completely eviscerate the boss wave. Investing into Pizza Cat's [[Wave Attack]] [[Talents|Talent]] makes this stage even easier, as you can snipe the backliners and instantly eliminate the Darkmadillos. It's just that easy.

